---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
---
<SiteLayout title="Privacy" description="Privacy notice for maccrate.ai.">
  <article class="prose-page">
    <header><p class="eyebrow">Site information</p><h1 class="display">Privacy notice.</h1></header>
    <div class="prose">
      <p class="updated">Last updated July 18, 2026</p>
      <p>maccrate.ai is a personal portfolio for sharing public experiments. It has no user accounts, advertising, analytics, newsletter, or contact form.</p>

      <h2>Website requests</h2>
      <p>When you visit the site, Cloudflare and the server hosting it receive the information normally included in a web request, such as your IP address, browser information, requested page, and time of the request. They process this information to deliver the site, prevent abuse, and diagnose problems. It is not used here for advertising or visitor profiling.</p>

      <h2>Contact information</h2>
      <p>Current public contact methods are listed on the <a href="/about#contact">About page</a>. If email is enabled later, this notice will be updated before messages are collected through that address.</p>

      <h2>Interactive projects</h2>
      <p>Interactive projects may use browser storage or supporting services of their own. Those details are described with the project. See <a href="/mira/privacy">Mira Machine’s privacy notice</a>.</p>

      <h2>Cookies</h2>
      <p>The portfolio does not set advertising or analytics cookies, so no cookie banner is currently shown.</p>

      <h2>Other websites</h2>
      <p>Links to other websites are governed by those sites’ own privacy practices.</p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>Current contact methods are listed on the <a href="/about#contact">About page</a>. This notice will be updated if the site’s data practices change.</p>
    </div>
  </article>
</SiteLayout>
